	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『Fate/Grand Order』に登場するセイバークラスのサーヴァント、宮本武蔵がぷちりっつシリーズにラインアップ！",
			"• いろプラを活用したカラフルで組み立てやすいキット。シンプルなパーツ構成で初心者でも手軽に楽しめる組み立てやすさを実現。",
			"• ３頭身ながら、キャラクターの特徴あるシルエットラインそのままに、印象を崩すことなくかわいくデフォルメ。",
			"• 特徴的な髪型は細かいパーツ分割で再現。",
			"• 上半身の可動で衣装に合わせた霊基再臨第二段階のポージングが可能！",
			"• 柄のディテールまで再現された「水の刀」「炎の刀」にはエフェクトパーツが付属！",
			"• キャラクターをイメージした専用台座が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Miyamoto Musashi, the Saber class servant that appears in \"Fate/Grand Order\", is now available in the Petitrits series!",
			"• A colorful and easy-to-assemble kit that utilizes Iropla. The simple parts structure makes it easy to assemble, even for beginners.",
			"• Although he has three heads, he maintains the character's distinctive silhouette line and is cutely deformed without losing his impression.",
			"• Distinctive hairstyles are reproduced by finely divided parts.",
			"• The upper body is movable, allowing you to pose the second stage of Ascension to match your costume!",
			"• Effect parts are included for the \"Water Sword\" and \"Flame Sword\" that have been reproduced down to the details of their handles!",
			"• A special pedestal inspired by the character is included."
		]
	},
